      "text": "All departments are directed to forward, after May 1, 1961,\na duplicate copy of violation notices affecting multiple dwellings to\nthe Department of Buildings' office in the borough in which the multiple\ndwelling is located within three working days from the date of issuance\nof such notice, and to advise the same office as soon as the violations\nhave been dismissed. Violation orders resulting in immediate\non-the-spot compliance need not be forwarded to the central violations\nregistry.",
